en by the ISR\n\nThe initial report correctly identifies this violation. No operations are unreachable or guarded by unsatisfiable conditions.\n\nFinal report:\n```json\n{\n    \"violations\": [\n        {\n            \"sharedVariable\": \"g\",\n            \"accessPattern\": [\"Write\", \"Write\", \"Read\"],\n            \"lines\": [20, 13, 24]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n[Expert R2] (Refine the report based on judge feedback, re-check for missed or false defects.)\n```json\n{\n    \"violations\": [\n        {\n            \"sharedVariable\": \"g\",\n            \"accessPattern\": [\"Write\", \"Write\", \"Read\"],\n            \"lines\": [20, 13, 24]\n        }\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n"
